# Build output, including the FetchContent cache Unity lands in. One per agent, so the pattern is
# any directory whose name starts with build.
build*/

# The lwIP reference clone. Read for engineering constants, never built and never shipped, and it
# carries its own history.
lwip_ref/

# Unity's generator bakes the absolute source path into the runner, so every tree produces a
# different one and two trees always conflict. CMake regenerates it from the suite on each build.
unity_runner.c

# Agent worktrees and session state. Each worktree is its own checkout of this repo.
.claude/
